{
    "title": "Ultimate Disc 3D",
    "description": "Immerse yourself in the highly competitive world of throwing games with \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc 3D \ud83e\udd4f\r\n\r\nThis sport simulator is full of sportsmanship: there are many levels, exciting tournaments, many options for the appearance of your Frisbee and your team, and of course, lots and lots of fun! Play matches in different stadiums around the world and become the best of the best in discus throwing. Your opponents never sleep, improve your sport skills, upgrade the speed of the disc and the power of the shot and try to win the coveted cup \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nStart your journey into the world of sports games with \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc \ud83e\udd4f and download it now for free!\r\n\r\n<b> Why you'll love our sports simulator: </b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae<b> Simple and straightforward gameplay: </b> the ultimate disc is suitable for everyone, and will be great entertainment for all family members\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d<b> Catchy graphics: </b> bright colors, great animations with realistic throwing games physics, you just must see these dances after completing the level\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f<b> Cool upgrade mechanics: </b> get rewards for passing levels and improve your characteristics also, discover a new uniform for your team or disks of unusual looking\u2028\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f <b> Each match is unique: </b> a huge number of levels where the behavior of opponents becomes less and less predictable, just like in a real sports games simulation\r\n\r\n<b> Completely offline: </b> you don't need an internet connection to have fun, play anywhere and anytime\r\n\r\nDon't be afraid of new challenges If you are a fan of sports games, show your best physical fitness and even get to the national team and go to the Olympic Games\ud83c\udfc5. Prove that you can reach the top of the tournament table together with your teammates. Don't believe that cool sports simulators exist? Don't miss \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc \ud83e\udd4f a great choice in the genre of throwing games and see for yourself otherwise.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Immerse yourself in the highly competitive world of throwing games with \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc 3D \ud83e\udd4f<br><br>This sport simulator is full of sportsmanship: there are many levels, exciting tournaments, many options for the appearance of your Frisbee and your team, and of course, lots and lots of fun! Play matches in different stadiums around the world and become the best of the best in discus throwing. Your opponents never sleep, improve your sport skills, upgrade the speed of the disc and the power of the shot and try to win the coveted cup \ud83c\udfc6<br><br>Start your journey into the world of sports games with \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc \ud83e\udd4f and download it now for free!<br><br><b> Why you&#39;ll love our sports simulator: </b><br><br>\ud83c\udfae<b> Simple and straightforward gameplay: </b> the ultimate disc is suitable for everyone, and will be great entertainment for all family members<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d<b> Catchy graphics: </b> bright colors, great animations with realistic throwing games physics, you just must see these dances after completing the level<br><br>\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f<b> Cool upgrade mechanics: </b> get rewards for passing levels and improve your characteristics also, discover a new uniform for your team or disks of unusual looking\u2028<br><br>\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f <b> Each match is unique: </b> a huge number of levels where the behavior of opponents becomes less and less predictable, just like in a real sports games simulation<br><br><b> Completely offline: </b> you don&#39;t need an internet connection to have fun, play anywhere and anytime<br><br>Don&#39;t be afraid of new challenges If you are a fan of sports games, show your best physical fitness and even get to the national team and go to the Olympic Games\ud83c\udfc5. Prove that you can reach the top of the tournament table together with your teammates. Don&#39;t believe that cool sports simulators exist? Don&#39;t miss \ud83e\udd4f Ultimate Disc